      "manifestId": "a3-fresh-2-L3-001",
      "problem": "Xiao Ming's bicycle is broken, and he cannot get home while the weather is turning bad.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "what": "Xiao Ming is riding his bike home from the park when the chain falls off. He tries to put it back on but fails. He feels worried because he is tired."
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "what": "Li Ming and Xiao Hong walk by. They see Xiao Ming struggling. Li Ming introduces himself as the new neighbor. Xiao Hong notices that Xiao Ming looks upset."
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "what": "Li Ming asks what is wrong. Xiao Ming explains that his bike chain is broken. Li Ming says he knows how cars work, but not bikes. He asks if Xiao Ming needs help."
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "what": "Xiao Ming says he really needs help because it is getting dark. Li Ming says they can look together. Xiao Hong suggests checking the owner's manual. The relationship between Xiao Ming and Xiao Hong becomes better because of this talk."
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "what": "Li Ming and Xiao Hong help Xiao Ming put the chain back on. It is difficult, but they work together. Xiao Hong holds the wheel, Li Ming fixes the metal links. Xiao Ming waits patiently."
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "what": "The bike is fixed. Xiao Ming tests it; it works. He thanks them. Li Ming says if he comes back, he can borrow tools. Xiao Ming rides home happily. The three become friends."
        }
      ],
